OL,3,GNEWSAPolice believed train attacker had
OL,4,Aschizophrenia, jury told
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice dealing with a man accused of
OL,7,Ftrying to kill 10 people on a train
OL,8,Fnoted he had schizophrenia following
OL,9,Fhis arrest, a court has been told.
OL,11,FAnthony Williams denies attempting to
OL,12,Fmurder passengers and staff on the
OL,13,FDoncaster to London King's Cross train,
OL,14,Fwhich made an emergency stop in
OL,15,FHuntingdon, Cambridgeshire, on 1
OL,16,FNovember last year.
